    "name": "objective_difference_threshold_corrected",
    "intuition": "Select pairwise preferences where the winner's objective is strictly better (lower) than the loser's by a positive threshold, enforcing correct winner-loser semantics by requiring winner's objective < loser's objective minus gap_threshold and using vectorized indexing for all pairs in the batch.",
    "implementation_hint": {
      "expects": [
